  "rows": [
    {"sourceRow": 1, "yBand": [222, 262], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/0", "text": "关系式（6.17）或（6.18）叫做**薄透镜公式**. 量 $d$，$f$ 和 $F$ 可"},
    {"sourceRow": 2, "yBand": [294, 340], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/1", "text": "以是正值，也可以是负值. 我们不加证明地指出，在应用透镜"},
    {"sourceRow": 3, "yBand": [367, 412], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/2", "text": "公式时，需要根据以下规则在各项前面标上符号. 如果透镜"},
    {"sourceRow": 4, "yBand": [463, 523], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/3", "text": "是会聚透镜，那么它的焦点是实焦点，并且项 $\\frac{1}{|F|}$ 前面的符号"},
    {"sourceRow": 5, "yBand": [563, 605], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/4", "text": "为“正”. 如果是发散透镜，$F<0$，并且公式（6.17）右边将是"},
    {"sourceRow": 6, "yBand": [642, 728], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/5", "text": "负值 $-\\frac{1}{|F|}$. 如果像是实像，项 $\\frac{1}{|f|}$ 的符号为“正”，如是虚"},
    {"sourceRow": 7, "yBand": [775, 837], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/6", "text": "像则符号为“负”. 最后，在实发光点的情况下，项 $\\frac{1}{|d|}$ 前的符"},
    {"sourceRow": 8, "yBand": [876, 919], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/7", "text": "号为“正”，如果发光点是虚的（即射到透镜上的会聚光束延长"},
    {"sourceRow": 9, "yBand": [970, 1030], "nativeRef": "p0205#1", "pointer": "/blocks/0/lines/8", "text": "线交于一点），则项 $\\frac{1}{|d|}$ 前的符号为“负”."},
    {"sourceRow": 10, "yBand": [1072, 1160], "nativeRef": "p0205#2", "pointer": "/blocks/1/lines/0", "text": "当 $F$，$f$ 或者 $d$ 为未知时，在相应的项 $\\frac{1}{F}$、$\\frac{1}{f}$ 或 $\\frac{1}{d}$ 前的符"},
    {"sourceRow": 11, "yBand": [1186, 1231], "nativeRef": "p0205#2", "pointer": "/blocks/1/lines/1", "text": "号为“正”. 但如果在计算出的焦距或者透镜到像的距离或者"},
    {"sourceRow": 12, "yBand": [1259, 1306], "nativeRef": "p0205#2", "pointer": "/blocks/1/lines/2", "text": "透镜到光源的距离的结果中得出负值，那么就意味着焦点、像"},
    {"sourceRow": 13, "yBand": [1332, 1373], "nativeRef": "p0205#2", "pointer": "/blocks/1/lines/3", "text": "或者光源是虚的."},
    {"sourceRow": 14, "yBand": [1404, 1450], "nativeRef": "p0205#3", "pointer": "/blocks/2/lines/0", "text": "**透镜的放大率**　透镜所成的像通常与物体的大小不同."},
    {"sourceRow": 15, "yBand": [1477, 1521], "nativeRef": "p0205#3", "pointer": "/blocks/2/lines/1", "text": "人们用**放大率**来说明物体和像大小的差异."},
    {"sourceRow": 16, "yBand": [1550, 1594], "nativeRef": "p0205#4", "pointer": "/blocks/3/lines/0", "text": "**像的线度与物体线度之比叫做线放大率.**"},
    {"sourceRow": 17, "yBand": [1622, 1669], "nativeRef": "p0205#5", "pointer": "/blocks/4/lines/0", "text": "为求出线放大率，我们再返回来看图 179. 如果物体 $AB$"},
    {"sourceRow": 18, "yBand": [1692, 1738], "nativeRef": "p0205#5", "pointer": "/blocks/4/lines/1", "text": "的高度为 $h$，而像 $A_1B_1$ 的高度为 $H$，那么"},
    {"sourceRow": 19, "yBand": [1771, 1852], "nativeRef": "p0205#5", "pointer": "/blocks/4/lines/2", "text": "$\\Gamma=\\frac{H}{h}$"},
    {"sourceRow": 20, "yBand": [1888, 1929], "nativeRef": "p0205#5", "pointer": "/blocks/4/lines/3", "text": "是线放大率."},
    {"sourceRow": 21, "yBand": [1960, 2005], "nativeRef": "p0205#6", "pointer": "/blocks/5/lines/0", "text": "由于 $\\triangle OAB$ 与 $\\triangle OA_1B_1$ 相似，可导出"},
    {"sourceRow": 22, "yBand": [2043, 2072], "nativeRef": "p0205#7", "pointer": "/blocks/6/lines/0", "text": "• 195 •"}
  ],
